Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:05.92,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 ATP1000 半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:05.92,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}蒂亚福 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}5 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 中岛布兰登 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.78,0:00:04.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Francis, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.78,0:00:04.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝贺你，蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:06.82,EN,,0,0,0,,You're back in a Masters 1000 final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:06.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,你又打进了大师赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:07.78,EN,,0,0,0,,How does it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:07.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:09.66,EN,,0,0,0,,It feels pretty damn good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:09.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:10.82,EN,,0,0,0,,Really happy with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:10.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:12.66,EN,,0,0,0,,It's been a great week
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:12.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周很精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:14.90,EN,,0,0,0,,and a great weekend, unexpectedly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:14.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个周末也出乎意料
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:16.38,EN,,0,0,0,,so I'm super happy with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:16.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我特别满意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:18.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously it was a big match tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:18.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚显然是一场重要的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:20.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Were there nerves at the start?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:20.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,开局的时候紧张吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:22.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, I've been serving horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:22.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊，我发球一直很糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:23.66,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I thought I actually came out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:23.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过其实一上场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:24.50,EN,,0,0,0,,feeling pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:24.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:26.62,EN,,0,0,0,,I guess I need to pick up my serve better
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:26.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得把发球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:27.12,EN,,0,0,0,,at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.62,0:00:27.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,在后段找回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:29.90,EN,,0,0,0,,I got in a good rhythm there at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:29.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,到最后我找到了节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:31.34,EN,,0,0,0,,You've coped without the serve,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:31.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有稳定发球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.56,EN,,0,0,0,,haven't you, so well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你还是扛住了，是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:32.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:32.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:34.10,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm just backing myself with my movement
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:34.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,我更相信自己的脚步
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:35.18,EN,,0,0,0,,and how I'm hitting the ball from back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:35.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有底线的击球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:36.98,EN,,0,0,0,,of the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:36.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,手感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:38.36,EN,,0,0,0,,And I'm returning great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:38.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,接发球状态也很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:41.42,EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, it's always good to have some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:41.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过能得到这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:43.18,EN,,0,0,0,,of the approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:43.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,认可，感觉总是很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:45.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Arthur Fils awaits in the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:45.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,决赛等着你的是菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:47.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, two showmen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:47.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,两个都很有表演欲的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:49.70,EN,,0,0,0,,What are you going to deliver for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:49.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,你准备给我们带来什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.70,0:00:51.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Hell of a show, and hopefully a double W
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.70,0:00:51.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,会有一场好戏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:52.40,EN,,0,0,0,,with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:52.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望能双赢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:54.32,EN,,0,0,0,,He's a hell of a player, moves great,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.40,0:00:54.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,他是个很强的球员，移动好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:55.70,EN,,0,0,0,,serves great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:55.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,发球也好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:57.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Again, he has shot making.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:57.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有制胜分的手感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:00:58.60,EN,,0,0,0,,He's going to want it. He's going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:00:58.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,他会全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:00:59.16,EN,,0,0,0,,to be pumped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:00:59.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,会很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:01.22,EN,,0,0,0,,And so am I. I'm excited to face him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:01.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也是，我很期待和他交手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.10,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, that's the best way to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,这才是赢球该有的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:04.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Good luck. Well done tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:04.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你好运，今晚打得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:05.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
